                  "https://developers.stellar.org/docs/learn/encyclopedia/security"
                ],
                "remediation": "Validate the amount before transferring, for example reject `amount <= 0` with a typed contract error (or check both bounds when the token has a maximum). Validate once at the entry point and pass the checked value to `transfer`/`transfer_from`.",
                "severity": "medium"
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Token transfer amount without validation"
              }
            },
