                "text": "The project declares a `soroban-sdk` version older than the configured minimum. Older major versions can miss API fixes, security patches, and supported runtime behavior. This is a policy signal: review the changelog and upgrade when practical."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "## Deprecated Soroban SDK version\n\nThe project declares a `soroban-sdk` version older than the configured minimum. Older major versions can miss API fixes, security patches, and supported runtime behavior. This is a policy signal: review the changelog and upgrade when practical.\n\n### Remediation\n\nUpgrade `soroban-sdk` to at least the minimum configured in `minimum_soroban_sdk` (default 21.0.0), then rebuild and rerun the contract tests.\n\n### References\n\n- https://github.com/stellar/rs-soroban-sdk/releases\n- https://developers.stellar.org/docs",
                "text": "The project declares a `soroban-sdk` version older than the configured minimum. Older major versions can miss API fixes, security patches, and supported runtime behavior. This is a policy signal: review the changelog and upgrade when practical.\n\nRemediation: Upgrade `soroban-sdk` to at least the minimum configured in `minimum_soroban_sdk` (default 21.0.0), then rebuild and rerun the contract tests."
              },
